  "releaseNotes": "English: Libmem.NET 2.1.0 hardens Hook/VMT failure paths and ownership while preserving the 2.0.0 Public API baseline. It adds external-process Hook failure/exit coverage, instruction-boundary validation, retryable unhook/VMT restoration behavior, and updated consumer documentation/sample guidance. 中文：Libmem.NET 2.1.0 在保持 2.0.0 Public API 兼容的前提下加固 Hook/VMT 失败路径与生命周期，补充外部进程 Hook、指令边界、可重试清理失败以及消费者文档/示例。 Full notes / 完整说明: https://github.com/CardResearchLab/Libmem.NET/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
